    <p>The blog is just getting started — but the audience it's building is one that values honesty above everything else. These are people who have been through something, or who are going through something right now. They don't respond to hype. They respond to real.</p>

    <h2>What I Offer</h2>

    <p><strong>Sponsored posts</strong> — Written in my voice, clearly disclosed, about things I've actually used or genuinely believe in.</p>

    <p><strong>Social content</strong> — Instagram, TikTok, and Facebook @wheresubaldo. Short-form, real, no scripts.</p>

    <p><strong>Affiliate partnerships</strong> — If you have a program and your product fits this audience, I'm open to the conversation.</p>

    <h2>What I Won't Do</h2>

    <p>I won't publish content I wouldn't want to read myself. I won't pretend a sponsored post isn't one. I won't promote anything I think would waste someone's time or money. That's not negotiable — it's the reason people trust this blog.</p>

    <h2>I Also Offer Digital Services</h2>

    <p>You're looking at one of them right now. I built this site from scratch while living out of a hotel room in Scotland, waiting on a government letter. No team. No agency. Just me, a laptop, and a reason to get something done.</p>

    <p><strong>💻 Web Design & Development</strong> — Fast, custom-built sites that load fast, look good on every device, and actually do what they're supposed to do.</p>

    <p><strong>🤖 AI Automation</strong> — Systems that handle emails, workflows, content scheduling, and customer responses automatically.</p>

    <p><strong>📱 Social Media Management</strong> — Instagram, TikTok, Facebook — managed, grown, and kept consistent.</p>

    <p><strong>🔍 SEO</strong> — Technical and content SEO so your site gets found on Google.</p>

    <p><strong>📧 Email Marketing</strong> — List building, welcome sequences, newsletters, and campaigns.</p>

    <p><strong>📢 Paid Ads Management</strong> — Facebook, Instagram, and Google ads managed properly.</p>

    <p><strong>💬 Chatbot Setup</strong> — AI-powered bots that handle customer questions and book appointments 24/7.</p>

    <p>I'm not an agency. You work with me directly, start to finish. <a href="/services">See the full services page →</a></p>

    <h2>Get in Touch</h2>

    <p>Use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>. Tell me who you are and what you're working on. The more specific you are, the faster we can figure out if it's a good fit.</p>

    <p><em>— Baldo</em></p>

